        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-709, Distressed Heavy Circular Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe distressed look of this cabinet knob grants it character and shows off the highlights of the 6 available finishes. The Distressed Half Round Cabinet Knob may have a simple shape, but that means 3 things. First, it is easy to clean, with no grooves to trap grime and germs--this is especially good for cabinet hardware used in kitchens and bathrooms. Second, the design will match any decor. Third, this knob is easy to grip and has no potentially sharp points. RK International's CK-709 Cabinet Knob has a diameter of 1-3/8 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-709 Simple Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TR100_size.gif?v=1704354719\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
